OL,3,GNEWSA'It's astronomical, it's hard for
OL,4,Apeople to get to work': Drivers' fears
OL,5,Aas fuel prices soar
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs the price of diesel hits more than
OL,8,F#2 per litre at some of Northern
OL,9,FIreland's forecourts and with petrol
OL,10,Fprices also soaring, motorists have
OL,11,Fbeen telling BBC News NI how it is
OL,12,Fchanging their driving habits.
OL,14,FThe ongoing conflict in the Middle East
OL,15,Fhas caused disruption around critical
OL,16,Fshipping lanes like the Strait of
OL,17,FHormuz causing the price of wholesale
OL,18,Ffuel to continue to rise.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
