OL,3,GNEWSA'It's astronomical, it's hard for
OL,4,Apeople to get to work': Drivers' fears
OL,5,Aas fuel prices soar
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs prices at the pumps reach a four
OL,8,Fyear high, the NI Consumer Council says
OL,9,Fconsumers are being
OL,10,F"disproportionately" affected as there
OL,11,Fare more diesel drivers and have a more
OL,12,Frural population.
OL,14,FIt said last week petrol prices were at
OL,15,Ftheir highest level since September
OL,16,F2022 following Russia's invasion of
OL,17,FUkraine earlier that year and that
OL,18,Fdiesel prices are "heading that way
OL,19,Ftoo".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
